{
  "name": "Dinero IA — Fase 1 A11 Editor (edit-loop)",
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveExecutionProgress": true,
    "saveManualExecutions": true,
    "saveDataErrorExecution": "all",
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "all"
  },
  "tags": [
    { "name": "dinero-ia" },
    { "name": "fase-1" },
    { "name": "editor" }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "Telegram Trigger (reply)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [-1200, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "updates": ["message"],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_TELEGRAM_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Telegram Bot — Dinero IA"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Escucha mensajes text. Filtra después por: es reply al 'Ask feedback text' del HITL workflow."
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "name": "Is reply to feedback prompt?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-960, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "is-reply",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.message?.reply_to_message?.text || '').includes('Editar brief') }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
      "name": "Extract brief_id + feedback",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-720, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const msg = $input.item.json.message;\nconst replyTo = msg.reply_to_message?.text || '';\nconst match = replyTo.match(/Editar brief ([a-f0-9-]+)/);\nconst brief_id = match ? match[1] : null;\nconst feedback = msg.text;\nreturn {\n  brief_id,\n  feedback,\n  chat_id: msg.chat.id,\n  user_id: msg.from.id,\n  message_id: msg.message_id\n};"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
      "name": "Lookup brief Supabase",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [-480, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/briefs_pending?id=eq.{{ $json.brief_id }}&select=*",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "apikey", "value": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY }}" },
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY }}" }
          ]
        },
        "options": { "response": { "response": { "responseFormat": "json" } } }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
      "name": "Check edit limit (max 2)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-240, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "limit-cond",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json[0] || $json).edit_iterations }}",
              "rightValue": 2,
              "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "lte" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
      "name": "Edit limit reached notice",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [0, 200],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "={{ $('Extract brief_id + feedback').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "=⛔ *Límite de ediciones alcanzado* (max 2 por brief).\n\nOpciones:\n• Aprobar la versión actual igual\n• Rechazar y procesar otra fuente\n• Editar manualmente en Supabase si tenés acceso\n\nNo se generará nueva versión automáticamente.",
        "additionalFields": { "parse_mode": "Markdown" }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_TELEGRAM_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Telegram Bot — Dinero IA"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007",
      "name": "A11 Editor LLM",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [0, -100],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "text": "=Brief original:\n{{ JSON.stringify((($('Lookup brief Supabase').item.json[0] || $('Lookup brief Supabase').item.json).brief_content), null, 2) }}\n\nFeedback de Manuel:\n\"{{ $('Extract brief_id + feedback').item.json.feedback }}\"\n\nIteración actual: {{ ($('Lookup brief Supabase').item.json[0] || $('Lookup brief Supabase').item.json).edit_iterations }}/2",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "Sos A11 Editor de Dinero IA. Tu tarea: aplicar el feedback de Manuel al brief original SIN regenerar todo desde cero — solo modificar lo que el feedback pide específicamente.\n\nReglas:\n1. Mantener la estructura JSON exacta del brief original\n2. Aplicar el cambio que pidió Manuel — nada más\n3. Si el feedback es ambiguo, hacer la interpretación más conservadora\n4. Si el feedback contradice voz Dinero IA (ej. 'pone más hype'), aplicar parcial — mantener integridad de marca\n5. Si el feedback agrega recomendaciones directas o promesas (regla 16/17 compliance), NO aplicar — devolver brief original + nota\n\nVoz Dinero IA: hook viral calibrado + body sobrio + disclaimer si productos. Sofía Macías + Mis Propias Finanzas model. NO recomendaciones específicas. NO promesas rendimiento.\n\nDevolvé JSON EXACTO con la estructura completa del brief actualizado (mismas keys que el original) — sin markdown, sin ```."
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008",
      "name": "Opus 4 — A11",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [0, 100],
      "parameters": {
        "model": "claude-opus-4-20250514",
        "options": { "temperature": 0.3, "maxTokensToSample": 2000 }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "anthropicApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_ANTHROPIC_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Anthropic API — Dinero IA"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009",
      "name": "Parser A11",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [140, 100],
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"required\": [\"title\", \"que_paso\", \"por_que_importa_finanzas\", \"hook_tentativo\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"title\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"que_paso\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"por_que_importa_finanzas\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"que_cambia\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"quien_gana_pierde\": {\"type\": \"object\"},\n    \"datos_clave\": {\"type\": \"array\"},\n    \"angulo_finanzas_latam\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"prompt_o_template_sugerido\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"angulos_posibles\": {\"type\": \"array\"},\n    \"angulo_elegido\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"formato_recomendado\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"hook_tentativo\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"cta_tentativo\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"disclaimer_requerido\": {\"type\": \"boolean\"},\n    \"disclaimer_texto_sugerido\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n    \"productos_mencionados\": {\"type\": \"array\"},\n    \"riesgos_editorial\": {\"type\": \"array\"},\n    \"fact_check_items\": {\"type\": \"array\"}\n  }\n}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010",
      "name": "Update brief in Supabase",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [380, -100],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/briefs_pending?id=eq.{{ $('Extract brief_id + feedback').item.json.brief_id }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "apikey", "value": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY }}" },
            { "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY }}" },
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
            { "name": "Prefer", "value": "return=representation" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"brief_content\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.output || $json) }},\n  \"manuel_feedback\": {{ JSON.stringify($('Extract brief_id + feedback').item.json.feedback) }},\n  \"approval_status\": \"pending\"\n}",
        "options": { "response": { "response": { "responseFormat": "json" } } }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000011",
      "name": "Format Telegram + Inline Keyboard (new version)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [620, -100],
      "parameters": {
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const saved = Array.isArray($input.item.json) ? $input.item.json[0] : $input.item.json;\nconst brief_id = saved.id;\nconst brief = saved.brief_content;\nconst score = saved.signal_score;\nconst sub_cat = saved.sub_categoria;\nconst iter = saved.edit_iterations;\n\nconst text = `*✏️ Dinero IA — versión editada (iter ${iter}/2)*\\n\\n*${brief.title}*\\nScore: ${score}/100 (${sub_cat})\\n\\n*¿Qué pasó?*\\n${brief.que_paso}\\n\\n*¿Por qué importa?*\\n${brief.por_que_importa_finanzas}\\n\\n*Hook:* _${brief.hook_tentativo}_\\n*Formato:* ${brief.formato_recomendado}\\n*Disclaimer?* ${brief.disclaimer_requerido ? 'sí' : 'no'}\\n\\n*Prompt:*\\n\\`${brief.prompt_o_template_sugerido}\\``;\n\nconst reply_markup = {\n  inline_keyboard: [\n    [\n      { text: '✅ Aprobar', callback_data: `approve:${brief_id}` },\n      { text: '✏️ Editar', callback_data: `edit:${brief_id}` }\n    ],\n    [\n      { text: '❌ Rechazar', callback_data: `reject:${brief_id}` }\n    ]\n  ]\n};\n\nreturn { brief_id, telegram_text: text, reply_markup };"
      },
      "notes": "Sin botón Regenerar acá — edit-loop solo permite approve/edit/reject. Regenerar es solo desde el preview original."
    },
    {
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000012",
      "name": "Telegram Send (edited version)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [860, -100],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "={{ $('Extract brief_id + feedback').item.json.chat_id }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.telegram_text }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown",
          "reply_markup": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.reply_markup) }}"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_TELEGRAM_CRED_ID",
          "name": "Telegram Bot — Dinero IA"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
